<title>SINGAPORE: ADVISORY- Singapore stock market shut for election.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY- Singapore stock market shut for election.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore stock market is closed on Thursday for the country's general election.</p>
<p>Trading will resume when the market reopens at 0100 GMT on Friday, January 3.</p>
<p>The key Straits Times Industrials Index closed down 1.66 at 2,216.79 on Tuesday, December 31.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
</text>
